###Marketing Spend Case Study

In the analysis, we will be using Google Cloud Platform to explore, clean, manipulate, and vizualize the data. 

##The Process 

#Step 1 - Data Ingestion & Initial Exploration
- Import all shared CSV datasets into Google Sheets for initial accessibility.
- Explore dataset schemas, data types, formats, and basic structures to understand source variability.
- Push the datasets from Google Sheets into Google BigQuery for scalable processing.
- Begin preliminary data cleaning (e.g., handling nulls, correcting data types, removing duplicates).
